5,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"Since this is the first day, we have no information to work with. I believe it is best to observe everyone's behavior and communication patterns. Does anyone have a specific strategy they would like to propose?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Misaki. Observing seems like the safest way to start. I don't really have a strategy... I'll just do my best to listen to everyone.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Observation is a sound starting point. I suggest we pay close attention to how people react to the pressure of the first few days and whether anyone attempts to steer the conversation too aggressively.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Asuka. A cautious approach is most logical. Let us maintain a neutral atmosphere for now and see who attempts to manipulate the narrative or deflect attention before any evidence is actually present.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with everyone. It's a bit nerve-wracking to start, but I think being patient and kind to one another is the best way. I'll do my best to listen and help us find the truth together.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"It seems we are all in agreement on the importance of observation. @Daisuke, you seem a bit hesitant; is there anything on your mind, or are you simply adjusting to the situation?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm just a bit nervous. I'm not very good at these things, so I'm worried I might say something wrong. I'll try my best to be helpful, though.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Nervousness is a natural reaction, Daisuke, but try not to let it cloud your judgment. In this game, hesitation can be misinterpreted as deception. It is better to be clear and concise in your statements.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Asuka is correct. Clarity is essential to avoid unnecessary suspicion. @Daisuke, do not let your anxiety dictate your speech. Simply state your thoughts as they are; honesty is the most efficient way to establish trust.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, please don't worry too much. We're all in this together, and it's okay to be nervous. Just take your time and speak from the heart; I'm sure we'll all understand.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Midori, your kindness is appreciated, but we must remember that emotional appeals can be a mask. While we support Daisuke, we should remain objective. I'm curious if anyone has a method for identifying the Possessed.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't really know how to find the Possessed. I'm sorry. I'll just try to pay attention to who is agreeing with who too much... if that's a good way to do it.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,Daisuke's suggestion is a valid observation. The Possessed often mirrors the Werewolf or the majority to blend in. I will be looking for those who agree too quickly without providing their own logical reasoning.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Mirroring is indeed a common tactic. However, we must also be wary of those who disagree for the sake of appearing independent. I will be analyzing the consistency of each person's logic as the days progress.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"That's a very sharp point, Ryuji. It's a delicate balance, isn't it? I'll try my best to be honest about my thoughts while still supporting the group. I hope we can all trust each other in the end.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"We have established a solid foundation for our observations. Let us conclude today's discussion and wait for the Seer's first divination. I will be reflecting on our initial interactions tonight. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope everyone has a peaceful night. I'll try to be more confident tomorrow. Good night.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Let us remain vigilant and objective. I will be analyzing the patterns of our discourse to see if any contradictions emerge. Good night.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I shall do the same. A quiet night of reflection will allow us to process today's interactions more clearly. I look forward to seeing how the information unfolds tomorrow. Good night.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Midori,,"It was lovely getting to know you all today. I hope we can all sleep well and wake up feeling refreshed. I'll be rooting for the Seer tonight! Good night, everyone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
